{"server":"kr","storyId":"main_3_level_main_03-03_beg","groupId":"main_3","stageId":"main_03-03","title":"회전","storyCode":"3-3","avgTag":"작전 전","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/kr/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"0c9d8598e9352c65db086a9557df124f7e2c34d246896df37b026e86233b2eb6","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"엑시아와 텍사스에 활약에 적들이 정신이 팔린 틈을 타,\n로도스 아일랜드 일행은 기습을 준비한다.","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二十五关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"죽어라!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"적은 둘 뿐이다! 가라!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"뭘 주저하는 거냐!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"벌써 동료가 스무 명도 넘게 당했어…!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"저 둘은 평범한 녀석들이 아니야…!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"엑시아","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"오른쪽 조심해!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"엄호를 부탁한다."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"그 녀석을 붙잡아! 내가 마무리한다!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"쳇, 지금 이 녀석들까지 상대할 여유는 없다."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"엑시아","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"다음에 한 잔 사는 거다?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"알았으니까 서둘러."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"엑시아","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"오케이~!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"엑시아","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"거기 오빠들~?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"어?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"엑시아","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"이 탄환은 선물이야, 잘 받아~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"탄환? 탄환이라니…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"윽… 으악!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"엑시아","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"대신 처리해 뒀어~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"고맙군."},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"이, 이것들이!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"저, 저 녀석의 칼은…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"아, 미안."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"…평소에는 이도류거든."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"으, 으아악!!"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"엑시아","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"이제 전부 정리된 것 같네."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"엑시아","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"우리의 콤비네이션, 역시 끝내준다니까!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"……그래."},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"놓치지 마라!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"적의 증원이 대량으로 몰려온다."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"이쪽에서 벌인 소동을 보고 달려온 것 같군."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"아아아!!! 제길!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"어째서… 너희들, 대체 무슨 짓을 한 거냐!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"엑시아","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"흐음, 개인적인 원한은 없는데."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"엑시아","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"계약은 계약이라서 말야."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"엑시아","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"계약을 성실하게 이행하는 건 물류회사의 기본이지!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"왼쪽."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"엑시아","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"엉?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"엑시아","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"어, 어라?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"엑시아","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"고, 고마워."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"그럼 내 오른쪽에 있는 적은 네게 맡기지."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"뛰자. 슬슬 이동해야 해."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":true,"text":"엑시아 씨, 곧 그쪽에 도착합니다!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"엑시아","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"우리가 적의 주의를 끌게. 너희는 알아서 움직여!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":true,"text":"그럼 두 분 모두 조심하세요!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"프란카 씨, 목표지점에는 도착하셨나요?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":true,"text":"여긴 오케이야."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리스캄","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":true,"text":"리스캄과 디펜더 팀도 목표 지점에 도착했다."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"모든 오퍼레이터 여러분, 잘 들으세요. 적의 스나이퍼가 지형을 이용하여 숨어있을 가능성이 있습니다."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"각자 위치에서 경계하면서, 스나이퍼부터 공격해 주세요."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"그럼… 여러분, 기습을 준비해주세요."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"…임무 목표가 있을 수도 있으니, 주변 피해를 최소화하는 것도 잊지 마시고요."},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["아미야"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["리유니온 멤버"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["텍사스"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["엑시아"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["프란카"]},{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["리스캄"]}]}
